[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/601312350","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/993#issuecomment-601312350","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/993","id":601312350,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYwMTMxMjM1MA==","user":{"login":"vmbrasseur","id":298927,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODkyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/298927?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vmbrasseur","html_url":"https://github.com/vmbrasseur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vmbrasseur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vmbrasseur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vmbrasseur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vmbrasseur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vmbrasseur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vmbrasseur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vmbrasseur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vmbrasseur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vmbrasseur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-03-19T17:25:40Z","updated_at":"2020-03-19T17:25:40Z","body":"Contrary to the request description, [this license is not approved by OSI](https://opensource.org/licenses/alphabetical).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/601312350/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/602011625","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/993#issuecomment-602011625","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/993","id":602011625,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYwMjAxMTYyNQ==","user":{"login":"silverhook","id":3227264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjcyNjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3227264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook","html_url":"https://github.com/silverhook","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-03-21T08:03:47Z","updated_at":"2020-03-21T08:03:47Z","body":"There are already two versions of this license (and no versioning), plus several translations of it:\r\n- https://github.com/me-shaon/GLWTPL/blob/master/LICENSE\r\n- https://github.com/me-shaon/GLWTPL/blob/master/NSFW_LICENSE\r\n\r\nThis would make it difficult to track in SPDX, but we could just go about it the same way as with CC licenses, if it gets approved.\r\n\r\nIt is not a very well written license as the most meaty part of the actual license is written even before the preamble.\r\n\r\nI assume this falls into the bag of “joke licenses” such as the WTFPL and the [Chicken Dance License](https://github.com/supertunaman/cdl), so the main question is how likely one is to use a package licensed under it.\r\n\r\nWith [~200 hits on GitHub](https://github.com/search?q=GLWTPL&type=Code), I would argue it is not very wide-spread – compared to e.g. [~830.000 hits that WTFPL](https://github.com/search?q=WTFPL&type=Code) has.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/602011625/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/605652043","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/993#issuecomment-605652043","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/993","id":605652043,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYwNTY1MjA0Mw==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-03-29T15:13:54Z","updated_at":"2020-03-29T15:13:54Z","body":"\r\n@vmbrasseur thanks for highlighting that this is **not** OSI-approved.\r\n\r\nFor the most part I agree with @silverhook's comments. Although it isn't versioned in the license author's text, the text that would be added to the License List (if it is included) should presumably be given a 1.0 version number -- so that if there are future updates, they could be distinguished.\r\n\r\nHaving taken a quick look at the search hits on GitHub, I see that many of these repos appear to be from different code authors / contributors. E.g., to me it looks like these show actual community usage rather than just the license author a couple of people using it themselves. \r\n\r\nGiven that, I'd tend to include it as just over the line of sufficient usage to warrant inclusion -- given also that it's drafted for use by anyone; and I think it's generally compliant with the OSD (in the same way that WTFPL would be).\r\n\r\nSo I'm a tentative +1 to add. Maybe a +0.8. Would welcome thoughts from others about the comments above.\r\n\r\nIf it's added, I would only add the standard one at this time, not the NSFW one -- not because NSFW licenses are necessarily a problem (see WTFPL) but because I'm not seeing the same general usage of the NSFW variant.\r\n\r\nI did also want to cc @me-shaon since it looks like they are the license author, and not sure whether they were aware of or supportive of this request to add GLWTPL to the [SPDX License List](https://spdx.org/licenses).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/605652043/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/605861154","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/993#issuecomment-605861154","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/993","id":605861154,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYwNTg2MTE1NA==","user":{"login":"me-shaon","id":831997,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMTk5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/831997?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-shaon","html_url":"https://github.com/me-shaon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-shaon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-shaon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-shaon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-shaon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-shaon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-shaon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-shaon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-shaon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-shaon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-03-30T08:35:54Z","updated_at":"2020-03-30T08:35:54Z","body":"I'm the author of the License and yeah, it was written as a Joke. I didn't even know that around 250 people used this in their project. :O \r\nAnyway, if you decide to add this to the SPDX license list, it's fine by me. Just let me know If I need to do anything on my end. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/605861154/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/658939663","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/993#issuecomment-658939663","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/993","id":658939663,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY1ODkzOTY2Mw==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","foll